> 
and you are carrying around what I guess is an uncursed luckstone to
ensure that your bad luck never improves? 

Doesn't sound like a bug to me, it sounds like you are getting exactly what 
you deserve. 

In more detail: killing the unicorn subtracts 5 from your luck, so your 
luck is probably now negative and possibly very negative. Searching calls 
rnl(7), which generates a random number in the range 0 to 6. It then 
usually subtracts one third of your luck (but if your luck is less than -5 
it subtracts all of it). Either way, subtracting a negative number leaves 
the randomly generated value always positive and the search only succeeds 
when the result is 0.

There is a 1 in (50-luck) chance that it won't subtract your luck, so you 
need to hit that chance at the same time as the random value came up zero. 
By my calculation, the chances of your search succeeding are probably about 
1 in 375.

You did search more than 400 times before deciding there was a bug didn't 
you?


